{"id":209,"date":"2026-07-09T20:47:05","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T20:47:05","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost:8181\/contact\/"},"modified":"2026-07-15T20:55:13","modified_gmt":"2026-07-15T20:55:13","slug":"contact","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/contact\/","title":{"rendered":"Contact"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull ks-page-hero\" style=\"padding-top:7rem;padding-right:32px;padding-bottom:7rem;padding-left:32px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-contrast-background-color has-background-dim-70 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-188\" alt=\"hvac technician repair\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-cover-is-layout-18da4dbc wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph ks-page-eyebrow\">Contact \u00b7 Measurement before recommendations<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tell us what the house is doing<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph ks-page-lead\">Start with the symptoms: uneven rooms, short cycling, humidity, noise, high bills, or a system that simply stopped. The first useful answer comes from the house, not a phone quote.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3b8eca09 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+17175550148\">Call (717) 555-0148<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/service-areas\/\">Check your service area<\/a><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ks-contact-section has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-bd1b4696 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:72px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:72px;padding-left:24px\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ks-contact-grid is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<form class=\"ks-contact-form\" aria-describedby=\"ks-demo-form-note\">\n  <p class=\"ks-page-eyebrow\">Assessment request<\/p>\n  <h2>Give us the useful details<\/h2>\n  <div class=\"ks-contact-form-grid\">\n    <label>Name<input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\"><\/label>\n    <label>Phone<input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"(555) 555-5555\"><\/label>\n    <label>Email<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\"><\/label>\n    <label>Community<input type=\"text\" name=\"community\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\" placeholder=\"Town or borough\"><\/label>\n    <label class=\"ks-field-full\">What is the house doing?<textarea name=\"symptoms\" placeholder=\"Tell us what changed, which rooms are affected, and when it happens.\"><\/textarea><\/label>\n  <\/div>\n  <button class=\"ks-demo-submit\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Demo form \u2014 connect Gravity Forms<\/button>\n  <p id=\"ks-demo-form-note\" class=\"ks-demo-note\">This pilot does not collect submissions. Production customer sites would connect the approved form and consent workflow here.<\/p>\n<\/form>\n\n\n<aside class=\"ks-contact-panel\">\n  <p class=\"ks-page-eyebrow\">Direct contact<\/p>\n  <h2>Keystone Comfort Co.<\/h2>\n  <p><strong>Phone<\/strong><br><a href=\"tel:+17175550148\">(717) 555-0148<\/a><\/p>\n  <p><strong>Hours<\/strong><br>Weekdays, 7:30\u20135:00<\/p>\n  <p><strong>Coverage<\/strong><br>51 Pennsylvania communities<\/p>\n  <hr>\n  <h3>Helpful before the visit<\/h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>System age, if known<\/li>\n    <li>Which rooms feel different<\/li>\n    <li>When the problem started<\/li>\n    <li>Recent utility bill changes<\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/aside>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ks-process-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-bd1b4696 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:72px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:72px;padding-left:24px\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph ks-eyebrow has-text-align-center\">What happens next<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading  has-text-align-center\">A clear first conversation<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns ks-process is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Describe the symptoms<\/h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We start with what changed, where it happens, and whether the problem is urgent.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Confirm the right visit<\/h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The house type, system, and location determine what should be measured on site.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Compare the options<\/h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After measurement, repair and replacement options are explained against the same set of facts.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-09418f18 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:28px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:24px\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph ks-disclosure\"><strong>Pilot disclosure:<\/strong> Keystone Comfort Co. is a fictional demonstration brand. The phone number is a reserved fictional 555 number, and the form above is intentionally disconnected.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Describe what your Pennsylvania house is doing and prepare for a measurement-first HVAC assessment.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_angie_page":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-209","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Contact - Keystone Comfort Co.<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Contact the Keystone Comfort pilot to request a measurement-first HVAC assessment in one of 51 Pennsylvania communities.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/contact\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Contact - Keystone Comfort Co.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Contact the Keystone Comfort pilot to request a measurement-first HVAC assessment in one of 51 Pennsylvania communities.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/contact\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\